menu "TINY watch service"

    config TINY_EMBED_MODEL
        bool "Embed model/TINY.BIN into the firmware image"
        default y
        help
            Links TINY.BIN (~380 KB) into flash rodata so a single app image
            is self-contained. If you flash TINY.BIN to a dedicated
            'tiny_model' partition or onto LittleFS instead, turn this off
            to keep the app binary small for fast OTA updates.

endmenu
